---
import CorporateLayout from '../layouts/CorporateLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<CorporateLayout
  title="About"
  description="The institutional mandate and working principles of Trinity Laboratories."
  active="about"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Institutional profile"
    title="A controlled practice of applied research."
    intro="Trinity Laboratories coordinates experimental, technical, and operational work around evidence that can be reviewed, repeated, and transferred."
    index="TL / ABOUT"
  />

  <section class="section" data-reveal>
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <p class="prose-large">
        The institution’s role is to make complex work legible—from the first test boundary to the
        final technical record.
      </p>
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Mandate</p>
        <p>
          Programs unite laboratory controls, instrument design, field observation, safety systems,
          and documentation. Each discipline retains its own standards while contributing to one
          traceable research record.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark" data-reveal>
    <div class="section__heading">
      <p class="section-label">Operating principles</p>
      <h2>Clear boundaries. Reviewable evidence.</h2>
      <p>
        Research is structured so another qualified team can understand what was attempted, what was
        observed, and what remains unresolved.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ol class="ruled-list">
      <li>
        <small>01</small><strong>Define the question and operating boundary.</strong><span
          >Scope</span
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>02</small><strong>Calibrate the instrument and document the method.</strong><span
          >Control</span
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>03</small><strong>Separate observation from interpretation.</strong><span
          >Evidence</span
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>04</small><strong>Preserve decisions, exceptions, and review history.</strong><span
          >Record</span
        >
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="section" data-reveal>
    <div class="section__heading">
      <p class="section-label">Institutional record</p>
      <h2>Selected 1986 materials are being transferred to the current records interface.</h2>
      <p>
        The migration preserves historical labels while adding normalized classification fields for
        search and review.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/publications/">Public releases</a>
      <a class="button" href="/employee-access/">Employee access</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</CorporateLayout>
